<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Higate says raises 30.76 million rand.</title>
<headline>Higate says raises 30.76 million rand.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Higate Property Fund Ltd said on Friday that it had raised 30.76 million rand by issuing 4.02 million new units at 766 cents each.</p>
<p>The firm said it would use the cash to refurbish a major Cape Town property, further develop two Pinetown properties and build facilities on a vacant industrial site in New Germany near Pinetown.</p>
<p>After these three projects are completed about five million rand will be left over for further developments, the firm added.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
